title: "AutoBoat at Virginia Tech — Website"
abstract: >-
  React + TypeScript + Vite website for Virginia Tech's AutoBoat team, a
  student-led engineering design team that designs and manufactures fully
  autonomous robotic sailboats and high-power electric motor boats. The
  site serves as the public-facing homepage (about, team, fleet, sponsors,
  gallery) and hosts a live boat map that polls the AutoBoat telemetry
  server for real-time positional and diagnostic data.
